  "body": "## Highlight \r\n\r\n* Stable transitive dependencies by @bastjan in https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/pull/164\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Add arm64 to MacOS binary compilation by @maximillianbrain1 in https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/pull/165\r\n* Enabling GitHub actions by @suriya-ganesh in https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/pull/184 and removing Drone  by @metalmatze in https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/pull/192\r\n\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @maximillianbrain1 made their first contribution in https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/pull/165\r\n* @suriya-ganesh made their first contribution in https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/pull/184\r\n* @bastjan made their first contribution in https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/pull/164\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jsonnet-bundler/jsonnet-bundler/compare/v0.5.1...v0.6.0",
